(87, 770, 'David Parker', 'davidparker@bigmir.net', '', '193.19.255.145', '2024-12-02 10:53:48', '2024-12-02 10:53:48', 'They have really taken their timeto work appearance of the theme, also, they have a very intereactive client assistance service, I like !', 0, '1', '', 'comment', 86, 0);
