(99, 1, '2024-11-27 08:47:50', '2024-11-27 08:47:50', '<h5>Accordions</h5>				\n					<h4>What is a digital agency?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"24px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24px\"><path d=\"M19 7v4H5.83l3.58-3.59L8 6l-6 6 6 6 1.41-1.41L5.83 13H21V7h-2z\"></path></svg></h4><p>Motion design utilizes animated elements, typography, illustrations, and other graphic elements to tell stories, convey messages, and communicate information in a visually engaging and memorable way.</p><h4>What services does a digital agency provide?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"24px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24px\"><path d=\"M19 7v4H5.83l3.58-3.59L8 6l-6 6 6 6 1.41-1.41L5.83 13H21V7h-2z\"></path></svg></h4><p>Motion design utilizes animated elements, typography, illustrations, and other graphic elements to tell stories, convey messages, and communicate information in a visually engaging and memorable way.</p><h4>Why should I hire a digital agency?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"24px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24px\"><path d=\"M19 7v4H5.83l3.58-3.59L8 6l-6 6 6 6 1.41-1.41L5.83 13H21V7h-2z\"></path></svg></h4><p>Motion design utilizes animated elements, typography, illustrations, and other graphic elements to tell stories, convey messages, and communicate information in a visually engaging and memorable way.</p><h4>How can a digital agency improve my online visibility?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"24px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24px\"><path d=\"M19 7v4H5.83l3.58-3.59L8 6l-6 6 6 6 1.41-1.41L5.83 13H21V7h-2z\"></path></svg></h4><p>Motion design utilizes animated elements, typography, illustrations, and other graphic elements to tell stories, convey messages, and communicate information in a visually engaging and memorable way.</p><h4>Can a digital agency help with content creation?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"24px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24px\"><path d=\"M19 7v4H5.83l3.58-3.59L8 6l-6 6 6 6 1.41-1.41L5.83 13H21V7h-2z\"></path></svg></h4><p>Motion design utilizes animated elements, typography, illustrations, and other graphic elements to tell stories, convey messages, and communicate information in a visually engaging and memorable way.</p><h4>How much does it cost to hire a digital agency?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"24px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24px\"><path d=\"M19 7v4H5.83l3.58-3.59L8 6l-6 6 6 6 1.41-1.41L5.83 13H21V7h-2z\"></path></svg></h4><p>Motion design utilizes animated elements, typography, illustrations, and other graphic elements to tell stories, convey messages, and communicate information in a visually engaging and memorable way.</p><h4>Do digital agencies work with small businesses as well?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"24px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24px\"><path d=\"M19 7v4H5.83l3.58-3.59L8 6l-6 6 6 6 1.41-1.41L5.83 13H21V7h-2z\"></path></svg></h4><p>Motion design utilizes animated elements, typography, illustrations, and other graphic elements to tell stories, convey messages, and communicate information in a visually engaging and memorable way.</p><h4>What industries does a digital agency typically serve?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"24px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24px\"><path d=\"M19 7v4H5.83l3.58-3.59L8 6l-6 6 6 6 1.41-1.41L5.83 13H21V7h-2z\"></path></svg></h4><p>Motion design utilizes animated elements, typography, illustrations, and other graphic elements to tell stories, convey messages, and communicate information in a visually engaging and memorable way.</p>				\n					<h4>Animations<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"24px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24px\"><path d=\"M19 7v4H5.83l3.58-3.59L8 6l-6 6 6 6 1.41-1.41L5.83 13H21V7h-2z\"></path></svg></h4><p>Motion design utilizes animated elements, typography, illustrations, and other graphic elements to tell stories, convey messages, and communicate informa