(247, 1, '2024-11-27 15:04:48', '2024-11-27 15:04:48', 'Who we are		\n			<h3>At the heart of a digital agency\'s services lies strategic planning and execution tailored to meet the unique needs and goals of each client</h3>		\n			<h3>We are creative development studio</h3>		\n		<p>A digital agency is a specialized firm that offers a range of services to help businesses thrive in the digital realm. With expertise in areas such as web design, digital marketing, social media management, and content creation, digital agencies play a crucial role in helping businesses establish and strengthen their online presence.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/contacts/\" role=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"24px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24px\"><path d=\"M5 7v4h13.17l-3.58-3.59L16 6l6 6-6 6-1.41-1.41L18.17 13H3V7h2z\"></path></svg>Get in Touch</a>		\n			<h3>UI/UX <br>\ndesign</h3>01<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/contacts/\">Read More</a>		\n			<h3>Web <br>\ndevelopment </h3>02<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/contacts/\">Read More</a>		\n			<h3>SEO <br>\nsolutions</h3>03<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/contacts/\">Read More</a>		\n			<h3>Digital<br>\nstrategy</h3>04<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/contacts/\">Read More</a>		\n			<h3>Video<br>\nproduction</h3>05<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/contacts/\">Read More</a>		\n			<h3>web developmentui/uxbrandingmobile</h3>web developmentui/uxbrandingmobileweb developmentui/uxbrandingmobileweb developmentui/uxbrandingmobileweb developmentui/uxbrandingmobile		\n			<h3>web marketingseomotionecommerce</h3>web marketingseomotionecommerceweb marketingseomotionecommerceweb marketingseomotionecommerceweb marketingseomotionecommerce		\n													<img width=\"1035\" height=\"690\" src=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/a-s1.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/a-s1.webp 1035w, http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/