(940, 1, '2024-12-02 15:10:47', '2024-12-02 15:10:47', '<h3>Where imaginationmeets innovation</h3>				\n					<h3><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/about-us/\" target=\"_blank\">development</a><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/about-us/\" target=\"_blank\">ui/UX</a><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/about-us/\" target=\"_blank\">Marketing</a><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/about-us/\" target=\"_blank\">SEO</a><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/about-us/\" target=\"_blank\">motion</a><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/about-us/\" target=\"_blank\">video production</a><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/about-us/\" target=\"_blank\">smm</a><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/about-us/\" target=\"_blank\">Analysis</a></h3>				\n					<h6>We are more than just a digital agency; we are architects of online experiences, engineers of digital transformation, and champions of innovation. </h6>				\n					<h3>who we are -</h3>who we are -who we are -who we are -who we are -who we are -who we are -who we are -who we are -				\n					<a data-magnetic-threshold=\"500\" data-magnetic-strong=\"0.2\" href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/about-us/\" role=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"24px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24px\"><path d=\"M5 7v4h13.17l-3.58-3.59L16 6l6 6-6 6-1.41-1.41L18.17 13H3V7h2z\"></path></svg>View All Projects</a>				\n					who we are				\n					<h3>From responsive web design to immersive UX, from search engine optimization to social media marketing, we offer a comprehensive suite of services tailored to meet your unique needs and goals.</h3>				\n					<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"24px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24px\"><path d=\"M5 7v4h13.17l-3.58-3.59L16 6l6 6-6 6-1.41-1.41L18.17 13H3V7h2z\"></path></svg><h3>Scroll Down</h3>				\n															<img width=\"1144\" height=\"1248\" src=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/homepage-6_3.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/homepage-6_3.webp 1144w, http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/homepage-6_3-275x300.webp 275w, http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/homepage-6_3-939x1024.webp 939w, http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/homepage-6_3-768x838.webp 768w, http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/homepage-6_3-1080x1178.webp 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1144px) 100vw, 1144px\" />															\n					our digital services				\n					<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/about-us/\"></a><h3>UI/UX design</h3><p>The digital landscape is ever-evolving, and digital agencies stay at the forefront of technology and industry trends.</p><img src=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/hp6-showcase-2-600x508.webp\" alt=\"\"><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/about-us/\"></a><h3>Development</h3><p>The digital landscape is ever-evolving, and digital agencies stay at the forefront of technology and industry trends.</p><img src=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/hp6-showcase-1-600x508.webp\" alt=\"\"><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/about-us/\"></a><h3>Motion design</h3><p>The digital landscape is ever-evolving, and digital agencies stay at the forefront of technology and industry trends.</p><img src=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/hp6-showcase-3-600x508.webp\" alt=\"\"><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/about-us/\"></a><h3>SEO services</h3><p>The digital landscape is ever-evolving, and digital agencies stay at the forefront of technology and industry trends.</p><img src=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/hp6-showcase-5-600x508.webp\" alt=\"\"><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/about-us/\"></a><h3>App solutions</h3><p>The digital landscape is ever-evolving, and digital agencies stay at the forefront of technology and industry trends.</p><img src=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/hp6-showcase-4-600x508.webp\" alt=\"\">				\n					<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/about-us/\" role=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"24px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24px\"><path d=\"M5 7v4h13.17l-3.58-3.59L16 6l6 6-6 6-1.41-1.41L18.17 13H3V7h2z\"></path></svg>All Services</a>				\n					our latest cases				\n					<h3>Here are some common types of cases that a digital agency might work on:</h3>				\n					<section><article><img src=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/portfolio-s1-1-1140x1140.webp\" alt=\"\"><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/portfolio/mobile-app/\"></a><h5><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/portfolio/mobile-app/\">Mobile app</a></h5><a href=http://pixl2026.acute.com/portfolio-category/branding/>Branding</a><a href=http://pixl2026.acute.com/portfolio-category/design/>Design</a></article><article><img src=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/portfolio-s2-1-1140x1140.webp\" alt=\"\"><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/portfolio/3d-objects/\"></a><h5><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/portfolio/3d-objects/\">3d objects</a></h5><a href=http://pixl2026.acute.com/portfolio-category/design/>Design</a><a href=http://pixl2026.acute.com/portfolio-category/development/>Development</a></article><article><img src=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/portfolio-s3-1140x1140.webp\" alt=\"\"><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/portfolio/ai-solutions/\"></a><h5><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/portfolio/ai-solutions/\">AI solutions</a></h5><a href=http://pixl2026.acute.com/portfolio-category/development/>Development</a><a href=http://pixl2026.acute.com/portfolio-category/marketing/>Marketing</a></article><article><img src=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/portfolio-s4-1140x1140.webp\" alt=\"\"><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/portfolio/business-identity/\"></a><h5><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/portfolio/business-identity/\">Business identity</a></h5><a href=http://pixl2026.acute.com/por