(1164, 1, '2024-12-03 16:32:49', '2024-12-03 16:32:49', 'Who we are		\n			<h3>At the heart of a digital agency\'s services lies strategic planning and execution tailored to meet the unique needs and goals of each client</h3>		\n			<h3>We are creative development studio</h3>		\n		<p>A digital agency is a specialized firm that offers a range of services to help businesses thrive in the digital realm. With expertise in areas such as web design, digital marketing, social media management, and content creation, digital agencies play a crucial role in helping businesses establish and strengthen their online presence.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/contacts/\" role=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"24px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24px\"><path d=\"M5 7v4h13.17l-3.58-3.59L16 6l6 6-6 6-1.41-1.41L18.17 13H3V7h2z\"></path></svg>Get in Touch</a>		\n													<img width=\"1364\" height=\"620\" src=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/t-s1.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/t-s1.webp 1364w, http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/t-s1-300x136.webp 300w, http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/t-s1-1024x465.webp 1024w, http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/t-s1-768x349.webp 768w, http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/t-s1-1080x491.webp 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1364px) 100vw, 1364px\" />													\n			our team<h3>Meet our digital skilled\nprofessional team</h3>		\n		<p>Digital agencies are at the forefront of the digital landscape, combining creative and technical expertise to help clients thrive in the digital world.</p>		\n			<section><article><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/team/monika-larson/\"><img src=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/team-s1-686x560.webp\" alt=\"\"></a><h2><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/team/monika-larson/\">Monika Larson</a></h2><a href=\"https://twitter.com/\"></a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/\"></a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/\"></a>(FOUNDER OF COMPANY)<i><svg width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><path d=\"M5 7v4h13.17l-3.58-3.59L16 6l6 6-6 6-1.41-1.41L18.17 13H3V7h2z\"/></svg></i></article><article><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/team/tim-burton/\"><img src=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/team-s2-686x560.webp\" alt=\"\"></a><h2><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/team/tim-burton/\">Tim Burton</a></h2><a href=\"https://twitter.com/\"></a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/\"></a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/\"></a>(ART DIRECTOR)<i><svg width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><path d=\"M5 7v4h13.17l-3.58-3.59L16 6l6 6-6 6-1.41-1.41L18.17 13H3V7h2z\"/></svg></i></article><article><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/team/leo-williams/\"><img src=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/team-s3-686x560.webp\" alt=\"\"></a><h2><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/team/leo-williams/\">Leo Williams</a></h2><a href=\"https://twitter.com/\"></a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/\"></a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/\"></a>(LEAD UI/UX DESIGNER)<i><svg width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><path d=\"M5 7v4h13.17l-3.58-3.59L16 6l6 6-6 6-1.41-1.41L18.17 13H3V7h2z\"/></svg></i></article><article><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/team/oliver-williams/\"><img src=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/team-s4-686x560.webp\" alt=\"\"></a><h2><a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/team/oliver-williams/\">Oliver Williams</a></h2><a href=\"https://twitter.com/\"></a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/\"></a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/\"></a>(LEAD DEVELOPER)<i><svg width=\