-200x200.webp\" alt=\"Christina Grant photo\">01<h3>Christina Grant</h3>Client of company<p>“Technical proficiency transformed our brand\'s online platform. Thanks!”</p><img src=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/testimonials-2-200x200.webp\" alt=\"Marry Johnson photo\">02<h3>Marry Johnson</h3>Client of company<p>“They revamped our website and crafted a tailored strategy!”</p><img src=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/testimonials-3-200x200.webp\" alt=\"Harry Newman photo\">03<h3>Harry Newman</h3>Client of company<p>“Our startup saw a significant boost in online visibility and sales.”</p><ul role=\"tablist\" data-carousel=\"wgl_carousel_68d4f703e2391\"></ul>				\n        <!-- .wgl-tabs -->\n					our services				\n					<a href=\"https://wgl-dsites.net/wuko/about-us/\" role=\"button\" data-cursor-class=\"wgl-element-f793216 cursor-global elementor-repeater-item-f793216 animation-zoom\" data-cursor-image=\"&lt;img src=&#039;http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/h8-lm.webp&#039; alt=&#039;&#039;&gt;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"24px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24px\"><path d=\"M5 7v4h13.17l-3.58-3.59L16 6l6 6-6 6-1.41-1.41L18.17 13H3V7h2z\"></path></svg>Marketing</a>				\n					<a href=\"https://wgl-dsites.net/wuko/about-us/\" role=\"button\" data-cursor-class=\"wgl-element-df25204 cursor-global elementor-repeater-item-df25204 animation-zoom\" data-cursor-image=\"&lt;img src=&#039;http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/h8-lu.webp&#039; alt=&#039;&#039;&gt;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"24px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24px\"><path d=\"M5 7v4h13.17l-3.58-3.59L16 6l6 6-6 6-1.41-1.41L18.17 13H3V7h2z\"></path></svg>UI/UX</a>				\n					<a href=\"https://wgl-dsites.net/wuko/about-us/\" role=\"button\" data-cursor-class=\"wgl-element-fda1eda cursor-global elementor-repeater-item-fda1eda animation-zoom\" data-cursor-image=\"&lt;img src=&#039;http://pixl202