(3516, 1, '2025-09-22 13:41:44', '2025-09-22 13:41:44', '<h2>we</h2>				\n					<h2>are</h2>				\n					<h2>a full-services</h2>				\n					<h2>digital</h2>				\n					<h2>agency</h2>				\n		<p>At the heart of a digital agency\'s services lies strategic planning and execution tailored to meet the unique needs and goals of each client</p>		\n					<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/about-us/\" role=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"24px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24px\"><path d=\"M5 7v4h13.17l-3.58-3.59L16 6l6 6-6 6-1.41-1.41L18.17 13H3V7h2z\"></path></svg>About Us</a>				\n					<h3>Bold Ideas </h3>				\n					impactful digital solutions				\n					<h3>Smart Strategies, Creative Design, and Technology That Work Together</h3>				\n					01<h3>UI/UX design</h3><p>We create compelling visual designs, logos, and brand messaging that leave a lasting impression and build strong connections with your audience.</p>				\n					<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/contacts/\" role=\"button\">Wireframing</a>				\n					<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/contacts/\" role=\"button\">ui/UX</a>				\n					<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/contacts/\" role=\"button\">prototyping</a>				\n					<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/contacts/\" role=\"button\">responsive</a>				\n					<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/contacts/\" role=\"button\">User research</a>				\n															<img width=\"740\" height=\"635\" src=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/h9-s1.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/h9-s1.webp 740w, http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/h9-s1-300x257.webp 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 740px) 100vw, 740px\" />															\n					02<h3>Development</h3><p>We create compelling visual designs, logos, and brand messaging that leave a lasting impression and build strong connections with your audience.</p>				\n					<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/contacts/\" role=\"button\">web</a>				\n					<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/contacts/\" role=\"button\">mobile</a>				\n					<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/contacts/\" role=\"button\">custom</a>				\n					<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/contacts/\" role=\"button\">E-commerce</a>				\n					<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/contacts/\" role=\"button\">seo</a>				\n					<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/contacts/\" role=\"button\">CMS integration</a>				\n					<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/contacts/\" role=\"button\">speed optimization</a>				\n															<img width=\"740\" height=\"635\" src=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/h9-s2.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/h9-s2.webp 740w, http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/h9-s2-300x257.webp 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 740px) 100vw, 740px\" />															\n					03<h3>Branding</h3><p>We create compelling visual designs, logos, and brand messaging that leave a lasting impression and build strong connections with your audience.</p>				\n					<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/contacts/\" role=\"button\">Graphic design</a>				\n					<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/contacts/\" role=\"button\">illustrations</a>				\n					<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/contacts/\" role=\"button\">Photography</a>				\n					<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/contacts/\" role=\"button\">product shoots</a>				\n					<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/contacts/\" role=\"button\">motion</a>				\n					<a href=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/contacts/\" role=\"button\">Video</a>				\n															<img width=\"740\" height=\"635\" src=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/h9-s3.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/h9-s3.webp 740w, http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/h9-s3-300x257.webp 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 740px) 100vw, 740px\" />															\n															<img width=\"248\" height=