(885, 1, '2024-12-02 13:38:42', '2024-12-02 13:38:42', '<h2>category: </h2>		\n		<p>Design</p>		\n			<h2>services: </h2>		\n		<p>WordPress, HTML</p>		\n			<h2>Date: </h2>		\n		<p>November 22, 2023</p>		\n			<h2>team: </h2>		\n		<p>Developer - Anna Lee<br />Designer - Tim Willson</p><p>Embark on a journey into the captivating realm of 3D character design, where imagination meets technology, and digital creations spring to life. In this comprehensive guide, discover the intricate process behind crafting compelling characters in three-dimensional space, from initial concept to final rendering.</p>		\n													<img width=\"1159\" height=\"764\" src=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/portfolio-s-1.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/portfolio-s-1.webp 1159w, http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/portfolio-s-1-300x198.webp 300w, http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/portfolio-s-1-1024x675.webp 1024w, http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/portfolio-s-1-768x506.webp 768w, http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/portfolio-s-1-1080x712.webp 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1159px) 100vw, 1159px\" />													\n													<img width=\"1159\" height=\"764\" src=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/portfolio-s-2.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/portfolio-s-2.webp 1159w, http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/portfolio-s-2-300x198.webp 300w, http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/portfolio-s-2-1024x675.webp 1024w, http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/portfolio-s-2-768x506.webp 768w, http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/portfolio-s-2-1080x712.webp 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1159px) 100vw, 1159px\" />													\n			<h3>Challenge & solutions </h3>		\n		<p>Unleash your creativity as you delve into the fundamental principles of character design, mastering the art of form, proportion, and expression. Explore the dynamic interplay of shape, texture, and color, breathing depth and personality into your creations with each stroke of the digital brush.</p><p>Step into the digital atelier and learn the essential techniques used by industry professionals to sculpt, model, and rig characters with precision and finesse. Harness the power of cutting-edge software tools to sculpt lifelike anatomy, refine intricate details, and imbue your characters with unique identities and emotions.</p>		\n													<img width=\"1170\" height=\"382\" src=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/portfolio-s-4.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/portfolio-s-4.webp 1170w, http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/portfolio-s-4-300x98.webp 300w, http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/portfolio-s-4-1024x334.webp 1024w, http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/portfolio-s-4-768x251.webp 768w, http://pixl2026.acute.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/portfolio-s-4-1080x353.webp 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1170px) 100vw, 1170px\" />													\n			<h3>Analytics & reporting</h3>		\n		<p>Navigate the intricate dance between technology and artistry as you tackle the challenges of character animation, mastering the nuances of movement, gesture, and expression. Learn to breathe life into your creations, infusing them with personality and charm through dynamic posing and fluid motion.</p><p>Unlock the secrets of storytelling through character design, as you craft narratives that resonate with audiences on a visceral level.</p>', 'Business identity', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'business-identity', '', '', '2024-12-02 13:38:42', '2024-12-02 13:38:42', '', 0, 'https://wgl-dsites.net/burido/?post_type=portfolio&amp;p=885', 0, 'portfolio', '', 2),
